WEBVTT

00:35:54.231 --> 00:36:00.531
that community depends on,
to some extent, deep roots of tradition.

00:36:00.555 --> 00:36:06.425
You cannot bring in,
in a very short period of time,

00:36:06.449 --> 00:36:10.826
huge numbers of outsiders with
different cultural and other assumptions

00:36:10.850 --> 00:36:15.335
and jam them in the same space
and expect things to go well"?

00:36:15.359 --> 00:36:17.053
Is that a reasonable point of view?

00:36:17.077 --> 00:36:19.256
DB: No. We're in Lower Manhattan.

00:36:19.280 --> 00:36:25.097
If you walk a half mile southeast
of where we're sitting,

00:36:25.121 --> 00:36:28.207
you'll pass where my great-grandfather
had a kosher butcher shop.

00:36:28.231 --> 00:36:30.601
You will pass where
my grandfather had a law firm.